/T (Again, we convert the single column of number of taxi rides into two columns, one for the value of count of taxi rides of the day, and the second column con- taining the number of taxi rides for the day afterwards \(to be predicted\) The network has a visible layer with 1 input, a hidden layer with 50 LSTM blocks or neurons, and an output layer that makes a single value prediction. The default sigmoid activation function is used for the LSTM blocks. The net- work is trained for 40 epochs and a batch size of 1 is used.)
/E (Again, we convert the single column of number of taxi rides into two columns, one for the value of count of taxi rides of the day, and the second column con- taining the number of taxi rides for the day afterwards \(to be predicted\) The network has a visible layer with 1 input, a hidden layer with 50 LSTM blocks or neurons, and an output layer that makes a single value prediction. The default sigmoid activation function is used for the LSTM blocks. The net- work is trained for 40 epochs and a batch size of 1 is used.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [9]
