908 0 obj
<<
/Title (We can also plot the predicted results of the SARIMAX model along with the in-sample data and the held-out data. With our SARIMAX model, we achieve an in sample RMSE error value of 300, while we achieve an out of sample fore- cast RMSE of 490. While our forecast model was only 15 data samples, we get a promising error metric, when considering that there are more than 7 thousand trips on average given any day in NYC.)
/Dest [22 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 910 0 R
/Next 906 0 R
>>
